{"ref":"BDB, מַחְבֶּ֫רֶת","hw":"מַחְבֶּ֫רֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְבֶּ֫רֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. thing joined, place of joining</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:4\" href=\"/Exodus.26.4\">Ex 26:4</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְבָּ֑רֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:11\" href=\"/Exodus.36.11\">Ex 36:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:17\" href=\"/Exodus.36.17\">17</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְבַּרְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:27\" href=\"/Exodus.28.27\">Ex 28:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:20\" href=\"/Exodus.39.20\">39:20</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>thing joined</em>, of curtain-pieces of tabernacle (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֹבֶ֫רֶת\" href=\"/BDB,_חֹבֶ֫רֶת\", dir=\"rtl\">חֹבֶרֶת</a>), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:4\" href=\"/Exodus.26.4\">Ex 26:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:5\" href=\"/Exodus.26.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:11\" href=\"/Exodus.36.11\">36:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:12\" href=\"/Exodus.36.12\">12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>place of joining:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  of the curtains <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:17\" href=\"/Exodus.36.17\">Ex 36:17</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  of shoulder-pieces of the ephod <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:27\" href=\"/Exodus.28.27\">Ex 28:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:20\" href=\"/Exodus.39.20\">39:20</a> (all P).","next":"BDB, מְחַבְּרָה","prev":"BDB, חֶבְרוֹנִי"}